  "description": "Aerith Gainsborough gets a +1/+1 counter whenever its controller gains life, lifelink included, and dying puts its last known number of counters on each legendary creature its controller controls",
  "note": "CR 603.2 / 702.15b / 603.10a / 603.6c / 122.1a. Healing Salve giving bob 3 life triggers nothing; giving alice 3 takes Aerith from 2 counters to 3. Attacking as a 5/5, its lifelink takes alice from 19 to 24 and gives it a fourth. Murdered postcombat, its leaves-the-battlefield ability reads the 4 counters it had (CR 603.10a): alice's legendary Isamaru (1 counter before) ends with 5 and her legendary Syr Alin with 4; her nonlegendary Grizzly Bears, her legendary noncreature Southern Air Temple and bob's legendary Isamaru get none.",
